#### 9. **Sports**
- **Khelo India Para Games 2025:** Haryana topped with 34 gold medals; Tamil Nadu and UP second and third.  
- **Baksi Cup 2025:** Held in Kannur, Kerala; Indian Naval Academy won.  
- **ICC Champions Trophy 2025:** India won, defeating New Zealand in Dubai; Rachin Ravindra was player of the tournament.  
- **Sepak Takraw World Cup 2025:** India won its first title, hosted in India.  
- **Retirements:** Sharath Kamal (table tennis), Sumit Reddy (badminton).  
- **Other achievements:** Novak Djokovic oldest man to reach ATP Masters 1000 final; Mira Andrva won Miami Open; LeBron James first with 50,000 combined NBA points; Lando Norris won Australian Grand Prix.

